  triage:description "AX.6 QA-1 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R1-1788626395, PR #1204 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T16:56Z) at head 490a6c42a0f3283c251875d9a61fcf99b641c2a2. crates/atm-core/src/team_admin/member_mutation.rs enforces the reserved `atm-daemon` sender rejection on both add and update paths through one shared helper, but no test exercises either path. Fix: add tests for both paths (rejection error code and that the roster is unchanged)." ;
